# Citation metadata for PebbleMapper. GitHub renders this as "Cite this repository".
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PebbleMapper, please cite it as below, and cite Soloy et al. (2020): the method paper for its Mask R-CNN detector and for the approach the pipeline follows."
type: software
title: "PebbleMapper: grain sizes from photographs and drone orthos"
abstract: "Detects and measures clasts (pebbles, cobbles) in scaled photographs and drone ortho-images, and turns the measurements into grain-size distributions, maps, zonal statistics, validation figures and reports. Detection is model-agnostic: Mask R-CNN is built in and other detectors plug in."
authors:
  - family-names: Soloy
    given-names: Antoine
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8597-2858"
    affiliation: "Continental and Coastal Morphodynamics Laboratory (M2C), University of Rouen Normandy, CNRS UMR 6143"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/soloyant/pebblemapper"
keywords:
  - grain size
  - clast detection
  - sedimentology
  - coastal geomorphology
  - Mask R-CNN
  - UAV
  - quadrat
